    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a UV-5 (300 µm) nozzle along a 28390 µm G-code path at 5.9 mm/min, filling a 29304 µm footprint at 464 µm line pitch, and report fill lines, print time, filament mass, extruded volume and deposition rate.",
    "rationale": "Pure bioprinting deposition calculation. The UV-5 nozzle has a 300 µm inner diameter (UV nozzle class, alias '3'). A single straight G-code path of 28390 µm is printed at 5.9 mm/min with ink density 1.007 g/cm³. The footprint of 29304 µm is filled with parallel lines at 464 µm centre-to-centre pitch. Fill lines, print time, extruded volume, filament mass and deposition rate are all derived from these raw inputs by the calculators.",
